      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشْخِيتٌ</span></b>  The <i>bringing, conveying,</i> or <i>causing
to come;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِبْلَاغٌ</span>. (K.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شخّتهُ إِلَيْهِ</span>
<i>He brought it,</i> &amp;c., <i>to him.</i> (TK.)

